      "task_id": "feature_01",
      "instruction": "【8MP UltraHD Bullet Camera】3840*2160 Pixels, this 4k ip poe bullet camera has 1/2.8” 8Megapixel progressive scan Sony CMOS sensor, which can help you get the highest quality images, 2.8mm lens provides you with 107 °Ultra wide angle. allowing you to cover more ground and keep more things important to you.Please log in to (ourdownload.store/ )for camera instructions and tool download.\n【Advanced H.265 Coding & Audio Recording】PoE IP security camera provides smooth stream, records more videos and consumes less bandwidth with the latest H.265 coding. The built-in microphone with the environment noise filtering records clear voice, providing vivid videos with sound without just silent live stream or playback.\n【Day or Night, Rainy or Sunny Day】this 4K IP camera optical zoom has a heavy metal weatherproof IP67 housing and IK10 resistant housing, with 4 built-in infrared LEDs, Advanced infrared technology, with far-infrared range, night vision up to 98 feet, and 120 dB wide dynamic, allowing you to get a clear image even under strong backlighting, providing you with clear day and night Vision.\n【Easy Setup & ON- VIF Protocol】Unlike analog CCTV cameras, this PoE (Power over Ethernet) security camera only needs one ethernet cable to transmit video signals and get power supply simultaneously.Compliance with Open Network Video Interface Forum specifications,It can guarantee the interoperability of third-party NVR products,It can be plug and play with Hikvision NVR, perfect connection.\n【Mobile Device Remote Management and Warranty】You can access the Apple App or Google Play Store through your smartphone, and download the \"Danale\" App for iOS or Android devices to view the real-time surveillance video stream. The P2P QR code can only be seen after logging in to the web operation terminal of the camera. This 8mp ip camera provides “2-Year” manufacturer’s warranty service and lifetime technical support. If you have any questions, please contact me in time.",
      "query_mode": "text",
      "query_image": null,
      "query_image_sha256": null
    },
    {
      "task_id": "feature_02",
      "instruction": "Operation Mode: CVBS:TurnUPand hold on 5 seconds CVI :TurnDownand hold on 5 seconds AHD :TurnLeftand hold on 5 seconds TVI :TurnRightand hold on 5 seconds   Camera Main Features  Model NO.:1AC-2612C-W-N  Image Sensor:1/2.7″Color CMOS with IR-Cut  Horizontal Resolution: 1920x1080TVL (1080p)  Video Output: HD-TVI(1080P),(AHD/TVI/CVI/CVBS)  Lens: 3.6mm  IR LEDs Amount: 36pcs IR LEDs  IR Distance: up to 100ft (30m)  Waterproof Level: IP67  BLC/WB/AGC: Auto  Material: Aluminum Casing  Package Dimensions(in):3.5*3.5*8.2  Weight:0.85 pounds  Operation Environment: ﹣20℃~ 55℃，10% ~ 90% humidity   Package Contents:  1x ZOSI 1080p 4 in 1 Bullet Camera  1x User Manual  1x Mounting screw bag  *Noted: 1.This camera did not come with power supply &video power cable!",
      "query_mode": "text",
      "query_image": null,
      "query_image_sha256": null
    },
    {
      "task_id": "feature_03",
      "instruction": "Catch everything with the enhanced night vision and colorful views regardless of the lighting conditions. The included backup battery makes it easy to switch out for a seamless transition. Place the camera anywhere that your Wi-Fi reaches. Pairs with The small size and sleek design of the Kami Entry Sensors and Kami Motion Sensors. They are perfect for securing the entry points of your home or business. With accurate motion detection, youll receive push alerts as soon as motion happens. 1080P wire-free home camera kit, wireless outdoor battery security camera with IP65, motion detection, night vision, 2-way audio True wireless security camera: powered by the rechargeable lithium-ion battery, the camera is totally wire-free, battery life is 1 whole month or up to 2,800 alert triggers Enhanced night vision: by adopting the SmartSens SC2310 CMOS sensor and IR cut filter, the wireless camera in this system provides enhanced night vision and colorful video views even under weak lighting conditions IP-65 weather resistant: with the IP-65 water-resistant design and 14F to 122F working temperature range, the Kami wire-free camera can be installed indoors or outdoors Smart security starter kit with base station, wireless window and door entry sensor, PIR human or pet detection sensor for home office business burglar alerts through Kami app Monitor your entire home: up to 65 ft. (20 m) reach from the Kami smart security base station to the Kami sensors, which allows you to you monitor and secure your entire home, simple device setup and installation means your home is secure in 5-minutes or less 1-year battery life: the sensors can last up to 12-months (depending on usage), simply connect the sensors with the Kami app, mount them on key points of entry and youre all set",
